<title>SOUTH AFRICA: ABI yr shr, div rises.</title>
<headline>ABI yr shr, div rises.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>    - attrib		  129.0	 vs 109.0</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 65.0	  vs 54.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   143.2	 vs 117.8</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   201.4	 vs 160.7</p>
<p>    Tax			 66.7	  vs 48.8</p>
<p>    Interest received     9.5	   vs 9.6</p>
<p>    Turnover		  1,786.7     vs 1,501.9</p>
<p>Full name: Amalgamated Beverage Industries Ltd</p>
<p>    Share of associates'  8.8	   vs 6.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said they will award capitalisation shares to shareholders registered on May 30. The number of shares they will be entitled to will be determined by the ratio that the final cash dividend of 53.5 cents multiplied by 1.06 bears to the average closing price of the company's shares on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange for the four business days ending June 26.</p>
<p>The board said further growth in earnings and turnover is expected given the firm's continuing committment to ongoing investment in the market place.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
